# libFuzzer dictionary for the paste-export target: decodeImage (src/docx/media.ts)
# and htmlToMarkdown (src/webview/markdownConvert.ts, Turndown with the GFM
# plugin and the mcMath and emptyTable rules). Input is HTML or an image payload.
# decodeImage: /^data:([^;,]+)(;base64)?,(.*)$/ then PNG/GIF/JPEG size sniffing.
data_png="data:image/png;base64,"
data_gif="data:image/gif;base64,"
data_jpeg="data:image/jpeg;base64,"
data_jpg="data:image/jpg;base64,"
data_other="data:image/webp;base64,"
data_plain="data:image/png,"
base64_marker=";base64,"
pct_encoded="%89PNG%0D%0A%1A%0A"
png_magic="\x89PNG\x0d\x0a\x1a\x0a"
png_ihdr="IHDR"
png_ihdr_len="\x00\x00\x00\x0dIHDR"
png_iend="IEND"
gif87="GIF87a"
gif89="GIF89a"
jpeg_soi="\xff\xd8"
jpeg_sof0="\xff\xc0"
jpeg_sof2="\xff\xc2"
jpeg_dht="\xff\xc4"
jpeg_sos="\xff\xda"
jpeg_eoi="\xff\xd9"
jpeg_app0="\xff\xe0"
jpeg_fill="\xff\xff"
jpeg_rst="\xff\xd0"
# base64 of the PNG magic and GIF header, which decodeImage then size-checks.
b64_png="iVBORw0KGgo"
b64_gif="R0lGODlh"
b64_jpeg="/9j/"
# Turndown: headings, emphasis, lists, code, links, images, tables (GFM), math.
h1="<h1>"
h2="<h2>"
p="<p>"
br="<br>"
hr="<hr>"
strong="<strong>"
em="<em>"
del="<del>"
s_tag="<s>"
code="<code>"
pre="<pre><code class=\"language-js\">"
ul="<ul><li>"
ol="<ol><li>"
li="<li>"
nested_list="<ul><li><ul><li>"
task="<input type=\"checkbox\" checked>"
blockquote="<blockquote>"
a_href="<a href=\""
a_title="<a title=\"t\" href=\"x\">"
img="<img src=\"x\" alt=\"a\">"
img_data="<img src=\"data:image/png;base64,"
table="<table><thead><tr><th>"
table_body="<tbody><tr><td>"
table_empty="<table></table>"
colspan="<td colspan=\"2\">"
caption="<caption>"
div="<div>"
span="<span>"
# mcMath rule: class mc-math with data-tex and data-display="1" for block math.
mc_math="<span class=\"mc-math\" data-tex=\"x\" data-display=\"1\">"
mc_math_inline="<span class=\"mc-math\" data-tex=\"x\">"
data_tex="data-tex=\""
data_display="data-display=\"1\""
# Markdown the converter emits and escapes (atx headings, fenced code, '-' bullets).
md_math_block="$$\x0a"
md_math_inline="$"
md_fence="```"
md_bullet="- "
md_star="*"
md_hash="# "
md_pipe="|"
md_table_sep="| --- |"
md_escape="\\"
entity_nbsp="&nbsp;"
entity_amp="&amp;"
entity_lt="&lt;"
cdata="<![CDATA["
comment="<!--"
script="<script>"
style="<style>"
